  "query_preview": "/Wednesday through Sunday/...\nA warming trend will continue Wednesday through Thursday as the\ncool core upper level trough moves east with weak ridging. A \ntrough from the Gulf of Alaska will move south along the BC \ncoast into the Pacific NW by Saturday with cooler and windy \nconditions possible next weekend. Uncertainty remains elevated \nin the extended period, as tropical activity in the Pacific \nenhances the jet stream. Models do not handle the energy \ntransfer well in these situations so expect lots of changes in \nthe far extended period over the next week with all these \ntropical systems across the Pacific.",
